1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,320
India sent a spacecraft to Mars
for less than a Hollywood movie cost.

2
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:08,700
Mangalyaan cost about
seventy-four million dollars.

3
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:11,450
The movie Gravity cost
around a hundred million.

4
00:00:11,930 --> 00:00:16,380
NASA's Maven, arriving days earlier,
cost nine times more.

5
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:20,660
And India reached Mars orbit
on its very first try.

6
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:23,240
It was the first Asian
country ever to do it.

7
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,470
So how did India do it so cheaply?
